<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;100584600">
	<b:glossaryEntry>combining audio and video recording in such a way that the sound is perfectly synchronized with the action that produced it; especially synchronizing the movements of a speaker''s lips with the sound of his speech</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
