</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;101216070">
	<b:glossaryEntry>a large subclass of diapsid reptiles including: crocodiles; alligators; dinosaurs; pterosaurs; plesiosaurs; ichthyosaurs; thecodonts</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;101216492">
	<b:glossaryEntry>extinct reptiles including: dinosaurs; plesiosaurs; pterosaurs; ichthyosaurs; thecodonts</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
