	<b:glossaryEntry>massive herbivorous bipedal dinosaur with a long heavy tail; common in Europe and North Africa; early Cretaceous</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;101228584">
	<b:glossaryEntry>extinct terrestrial reptiles: theropods (carnivorous); sauropods (herbivorous)</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
