	<b:glossaryEntry>any of various long-tailed primates (excluding the prosimians)</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;101978701">
	<b:glossaryEntry>of Africa Arabia or Asia; having nonprehensile tails and nostrils close together</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
