	 b:glossaryEntry="type and sole genus of the Sphyraenidae: barracuda"/>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;102093002">
	<b:glossaryEntry>any voracious marine fish of the genus Sphyraena having an elongated cylindrical body and large mouth with projecting lower jaw and long strong teeth</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
