</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;106415410">
	<b:glossaryEntry>the capital and largest city of Sri Lanka; one of the largest harbors in the world; located on the western coast of the island</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;106415632">
	<b:glossaryEntry>a landlocked desert republic in north-central Africa; was under French control until 1960</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
