	<b:glossaryEntry>the capital and largest city of Chad; located in the southwestern on the Shari river</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;106416037">
	<b:glossaryEntry>a republic in S South America on the western slopes of the Andes</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;106416533">
	<b:glossaryEntry>the largest Chilean island and the only one to be settled; located off south-central Chile</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
