</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;106510590">
	<b:glossaryEntry>a city in western India just off the coast of the Arabian Sea; India''s 2nd largest city (after Calcutta); has the only natural deep-water harbor in western India</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
