	<b:glossaryEntry>capital and largest city of Indonesia; located on the island of Java; founded by the Dutch in 17th century</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;106514230">
	<b:glossaryEntry>a city in Indonesia; located on western Java (southeast of Jakarta); a resort known for its climate</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;106514401">
