</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;106818990">
	<b:glossaryEntry>a river that rises in southeastern Kentucky and flows westward through northern Tennessee to become a tributary of the Ohio River in southwestern Kentucky</b:glossaryEntry>
