	<b:glossaryEntry>a member of the Protestant church founded in the US by Mary Baker Eddy</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;106996501">
	<b:glossaryEntry>a member of Christian denomination that expects the imminent advent of Christ</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;106996653">
	<b:glossaryEntry>in this sense `Gentile'' denotes a Christian as contrasted with a Jew; `goy'' is a derogatory word for Christians used by Jews</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;106996865">
