</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;108071548">
	<b:glossaryEntry>genus of pinnate-leaved shrubs and small trees of tropical and subtropical North and South America and India and West Africa</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;108071773">
	<b:glossaryEntry>any of various shrubs and small trees valued for their fine foliage and attractive spreading habit and clustered white to deep pink or red flowers</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;108071995">
	<b:glossaryEntry>small genus of tropical American timber trees closely allied to genus Albiza</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;108072189">
