</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;108078614">
	<b:glossaryEntry>North American perennial having pinkish flowers in loose cymes; used in folk medicine for pain or inflammation in joints</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
