	<b:glossaryEntry>from Mediterranean region; a naturalized weed throughout southern Europe</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;108193539">
	<b:glossaryEntry>large genus of low tufted herbs of temperate and arctic regions</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
