</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;108234668">
	<b:glossaryEntry>wildflower with heart-shaped leaves and broad yellow flower heads; of alpine areas west of the Rockies from Alaska to southern California</b:glossaryEntry>
