	<b:glossaryEntry>one of many families or subfamilies into which some classification systems subdivide the Liliaceae but not widely accepted; sometimes included in subfamily Amaryllidaceae</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;108739895">
	<b:glossaryEntry>genus of showy South American herbs with leafy stems; sometimes placed in family Alstroemeriaceae or in family Amaryllidaceae</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
