	<b:glossaryEntry>one of many subfamilies into which some classification systems subdivide the Liliaceae but not widely accepted</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;108772885">
	<b:glossaryEntry>sometimes placed in family Convallariaceae: lily_of_the_valley</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;108773063">
