</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;108866515">
	<b:glossaryEntry>reddish or black juice or resin from certain trees of the genus Pterocarpus and used in medicine and tanning etc</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;108866734">
	<b:glossaryEntry>tree of India and East Indies yielding a hard fragrant timber prized for cabinetwork and dark red heartwood used as a dyewood</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
