	<b:glossaryEntry>very spiny and dense evergreen shrub with fragrant golden-yellow flowers; common throughout western Europe</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;108875460">
	<b:glossaryEntry>widely distributed genus of annual or perennial and often climbing herbs</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;108875693">
