</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;108878606">
	<b:glossaryEntry>erect bushy annual widely cultivated in warm regions of India and Indonesia and United States for forage and especially its edible seeds; chief source of bean sprouts used in Chinese cookery; sometimes plaaaced in genus Phaseolus</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
