</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;109005675">
	<b:glossaryEntry>eastern North American plant having a terminal cluster of small white flowers and medicinal roots</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;109005937">
	<b:glossaryEntry>dried root of two plants of the genus Polygala containing an irritating saponin</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;109006107">
