</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;109006341">
	<b:glossaryEntry>a family of dicotyledonous plants of order Geraniales; have flowers that are divide into four or five parts and usually have a strong scent</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;109006737">
	<b:glossaryEntry>type genus of the Rutaceae; strong-scented Eurasian herbs and subherbs</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;109006909">
