	 b:glossaryEntry="a holly shrub"/>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;109057717">
	<b:glossaryEntry>the cashew family; trees and shrubs and vines having resinous (sometimes poisonous) juice; includes cashew and mango and pistachio and poison ivy and sumac</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
