	<b:glossaryEntry>aromatic dwarf shrub common on banks and hillsides in Europe; naturalized in United States</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;109169014">
	<b:glossaryEntry>genus of North American aromatic herbs or subshrubs: blue curls</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;109169212">
	<b:glossaryEntry>any of several plants of the genus Trichostema having whorls of small blue flowers</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
