	 b:glossaryEntry="bristle ferns; kidney ferns"/>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;109248621">
	<b:glossaryEntry>any fern of the genus Trichomanes having large pinnatifid often translucent fronds; most are epiphytic on tree branches and twigs or terrestrial on mossy banks</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
