</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;110294428">
	<b:glossaryEntry>glossitis with atrophy of tongue tissue; sometimes accompanies pernicious anemia</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;110294572">
	<b:glossaryEntry>a superficial form of glossitis marked by irregular red patches on the tongue and sensitivity to hot or spicy food</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
