</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;110687413">
	<b:glossaryEntry>an aromatic exudate from the mastic tree; used chiefly in varnishes</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;110687533">
	<b:glossaryEntry>a naturally occurring mixture of a resin and an essential oil; obtained from certain plants</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;110687788">
	<b:glossaryEntry>any of various fragrant oleoresins used in medicines and perfumes</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;110687979">
	<b:glossaryEntry>any of various aromatic resinous substances used for healing and soothing</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
