</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;110690738">
	<b:glossaryEntry>a substance that is opaque to X rays; when administered orally or intravenously it allows a radiologist to examine the organ or tissue it fills</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
