	<b:glossaryEntry>a soil that develops in temperate to cold moist climates under coniferous or heath vegetation; an organic mat over a gray leached layer</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;110760070">
	<b:glossaryEntry>(chemical warfare) a gas that is poisonous to breath or contact</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;110760226">
	<b:glossaryEntry>a complex ester used for making fibers or resins or plastics or as a plasticizer</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
