<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;200269675">
	<b:glossaryEntry>make a pillaging or destructive raid on (a place), as in wartimes</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;200269813">
	<b:glossaryEntry>grow weak and thin or waste away physically; "She emaciated during the chemotherapy"</b:glossaryEntry>
