	<b:glossaryEntry>of games, in sports: "The Giants dropped 11 of their first 13"</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;200744139">
	<b:glossaryEntry>be the winner in a contest or competition; be victorious; "He won the Gold Medal in skating"; "Our home team won"; "Win the game"</b:glossaryEntry>
