</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;200745497">
	<b:glossaryEntry>prove superior; "The champion prevailed, though it was a hard fight"</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;200745640">
	<b:glossaryEntry>come out better in a competition, race, or conflict; "Agassi beat Becker in tennsi championship"; "We beat the competition"; "Harvard defeated Yale in the last football game"</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
