	<b:glossaryEntry>support oneself by doing a certain type of work; "She lives on the meager income from her writing"</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;200787073">
	<b:glossaryEntry>use up, as of resources or materials; "this car consumes a lot of gas"; "We exhausted our savings"; "They run through 20 bottles of wine a week"</b:glossaryEntry>
