	<b:glossaryEntry>of insects, scorpions, or other animals; "A bee stung my arm yesterday."</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;200991333">
	<b:glossaryEntry>bite or chew on with the teeth; "gnaw an old cracker"; "chewed on a cookie"</b:glossaryEntry>
