</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;400256463">
	<b:glossaryEntry>in a very painful manner; "the progress was agonizingly slow"</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;400256649">
