</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;400270799">
	<b:glossaryEntry>at or near or toward the stern of a ship or tail of an airplane; "stow the luggage aft"; "ships with square sails sail fairly efficiently with the wind abaft"; "the captain looked astern to see what the fuss was about"</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;400271084">
