<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;400281927">
	<b:glossaryEntry>with the use of colloquial expressions; "this building is colloquially referred to as The Barn"</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;400282149">
	<b:glossaryEntry>in a self-collected or self-possessed manner; "he announced the death of his father collectedly"</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;400282334">
	<b:glossaryEntry xml:space='preserve'><![CDATA[in a bellicose contentious manner; "`Don''t trespass onto my property,'' the neighbor shouted combatively"]]></b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;400282526">
