	<b:glossaryEntry>in jest; "I asked him jokingly whether he thought he could drive the Calcutta-Peshawar express"</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;400379306">
	<b:glossaryEntry>with humor; "they tried to deal with this painful subject jocularly"</b:glossaryEntry>
