	 b:glossaryEntry="at a distant time in the past (chiefly Scottish)"/>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;400380968">
	<b:glossaryEntry>in a languid and lethargic manner; "the men languidly put on their jackets"</b:glossaryEntry>
