	<b:glossaryEntry>in a clear and lucid manner; "this is a lucidly written book"</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;400384718">
	<b:glossaryEntry>in an unenthusiastically lukewarm manner; "he was lukewarmly received by his relatives"</b:glossaryEntry>
