</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;400453393">
	<b:glossaryEntry>in a sneaky manner; "I always felt sneakingly that I wanted to be a concert pianist"</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;400453534">
