</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;400453763">
	<b:glossaryEntry>in a snobbish manner; "they snobbishly excluded their less wealthy friends from the party"</b:glossaryEntry>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="&a;400453968">
